<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title><%= title %></title>
    <style>
      :root {
        color-scheme: light;
        font-family: "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
      }

      body {
        margin: 0;
        min-height: 100vh;
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
        background: #f4f7fb;
        color: #16202a;
      }

      main {
        width: min(640px, calc(100vw - 32px));
        padding: 32px;
        border-radius: 20px;
        background: #ffffff;
        box-shadow: 0 18px 40px rgba(22, 32, 42, 0.08);
      }

      h1 {
        margin: 0 0 12px;
        font-size: 2rem;
      }

      p {
        margin: 0;
        line-height: 1.6;
        color: #415364;
      }

      code {
        background: #eef3f8;
        padding: 2px 6px;
        border-radius: 6px;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main>
      <h1><%= title %></h1>
      <p>
        The public check page and admin portal are available. User checks require
        explicit server selection and never auto-switch proxies.
      </p>
      <p style="margin-top: 16px">User check page: <code>/check</code></p>
      <p style="margin-top: 16px">Health endpoint: <code>/health</code></p>
      <p style="margin-top: 16px">Admin login: <code>/admin/login</code></p>
    </main>
  </body>
  </html>
